  "description": "Discover the adventure on your doorstep – your Backroad AL is ready for it. Explore new paths and conquer new terrain. With room for wide tyres and even more room for luggage, a sturdy aluminium frame and comfortable geometry, there are no limits to your desire to explore. Highlights: • Integrated frame compartment – with tool bag for your tools • USB-C port – power directly on the handlebar (power bank required) • 18 attachment points – plenty of space for bottles, bags and cages • Tyre clearance up to 53 mm – comfort and grip on rough terrain • Frame bags, mudguards and more -– available as accessories The Backroad AL GRX 610 comes with Shimano's mechanical 1x12 gravel groupset GRX RX610, wide 45 mm Terra Adventure tyres from Continental, robust Rose G25 aluminium wheels (25 mm rim width), gravel handlebars from Ritchey and a sporty saddle from Selle Italia. A gravel bike that can do it all – wherever your path takes you. Weight: approx. 10.5 kg, may vary by up to +/- 5 % due to manufacturing tolerances, reference frame colour soil, size M, without pedals and tool bag",
